  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2792545f-0539-5271-b269-b1f074663614" activityNameId="b6e784c7-c2fa-5037-a56d-816d5aa39449" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Use, printer, laser jet, colour, per kg printed paper</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Use, printer, laser jet, colour, per kg printed paper
The laser jet printer use (color, office) is calculated via the active mode electricity consumption taken from literature information. The dataset includes the share of the printer production (assumed life span 4 years, running 240 days a year), the energy consumption for the active mode, the rail and road transport from factory to user, the toner usage as well as the benzene emissions for the printing of 1 kg of paper.;
UUID: c23fb2b5-d9f2-3e71-ab50-1571f98512cd
Describes the use of a laser jet printer (color) in an office. Calculated per 1 kg of printed paper. UCTE production mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of printer and toner, which are represented in the individual subdatasets.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturers, literature and own assumptions. 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Assumptions had to be made for the printer life span.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c23fb2b5-d9f2-3e71-ab50-1571f98512cd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
